 courageous and i've  i've congratulated them i've appeared on  public platforms with them  but this issue about diana but let me  just say this i find it a bit  hypocritical  that terms salvage avid and the prime  minister have referred to dying in that  way  because it was the conservative campaign  the conservative party campaign  that during the election said a lot of  the criticisms  well that set the dogs onto diane if you  look at what happened in the media  the tory press were abysmal and that was  set  up by the conservative party during  their campaign they  personalized the campaign because they  did not want to debate the policy issues  so i find it  somewhat hypocritical i have to say okay  now a very quick thought from you  because we are running out of time but  i'm interested to get your  reaction to the news that a prominent  saudi journalist  has disappeared in turkey after going  into the saudi arabian consulate there  your reaction it's appalling  if the information is true that's coming  out it's absolutely appalling it's  unacceptable  we along with other nations now should  stand up to the saudi government and  make sure they know  it's unacceptable and if this means  taking action in some form  we should take those actions i've been  on a number of  demonstrations when the saudi regime has  sent representatives here because of  human rights abuses  and if this is another example of that  we've got to be much firmer  mcdonald john mcdonnell thank you very  much

